{"page":193,"verses":[{"verse_key":"9:37","surah":9,"ayah":37,"ar_uthmani":"إِنَّمَا ٱلنَّسِىٓءُ زِيَادَةٌ فِى ٱلْكُفْرِ ۖ يُضَلُّ بِهِ ٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا۟ يُحِلُّونَهُۥ عَامًا وَيُحَرِّمُونَهُۥ عَامًا لِّيُوَاطِـُٔوا۟ عِدَّةَ مَا حَرَّمَ ٱللَّهُ فَيُحِلُّوا۟ مَا حَرَّمَ ٱللَّهُ ۚ زُيِّنَ لَهُمْ سُوٓءُ أَعْمَـٰلِهِمْ ۗ وَٱللَّهُ لَا يَهْدِى ٱلْقَوْمَ ٱلْكَـٰفِرِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Postponing sacred months is another act of disobedience by which those who disregard [God] are led astray: they will allow it one year and forbid it in another in order outwardly to conform with the number of God’s sacred months, but in doing so they permit what God has forbidden. Their evil deeds are made alluring to them: God does not guide those who disregard [Him].","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِنَّمَا","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"innamā","verse_key":"9:37"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلنَّسِىٓءُ","en_gloss":"the postponing","transliteration":"l-nasīu","verse_key":"9:37"},{"pos":3,"ar":"زِيَادَةٌۭ","en_gloss":"(is) an increase","transliteration":"ziyādatun","verse_key":"9:37"},{"pos":4,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"9:37"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلْكُفْرِ ۖ","en_gloss":"the disbelief","transliteration":"l-kuf'ri","verse_key":"9:37"},{"pos":6,"ar":"يُضَلُّ","en_gloss":"are led astray","transliteration":"yuḍallu","verse_key":"9:37"},{"pos":7,"ar":"بِهِ","en_gloss":"by it","transliteration":"bihi","verse_key":"9:37"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"9:37"},{"pos":9,"ar":"كَفَرُوا۟","en_gloss":"disbelieve","transliteration":"kafarū","verse_key":"9:37"},{"pos":10,"ar":"يُحِلُّونَهُۥ","en_gloss":"They make it lawful","transliteration":"yuḥillūnahu","verse_key":"9:37"},{"pos":11,"ar":"عَامًۭا","en_gloss":"one year","transliteration":"ʿāman","verse_key":"9:37"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَيُحَرِّمُونَهُۥ","en_gloss":"and make it unlawful","transliteration":"wayuḥarrimūnahu","verse_key":"9:37"},{"pos":13,"ar":"عَامًۭا","en_gloss":"(another) year","transliteration":"ʿāman","verse_key":"9:37"},{"pos":14,"ar":"لِّيُوَاطِـُٔوا۟","en_gloss":"to adjust","transliteration":"liyuwāṭiū","verse_key":"9:37"},{"pos":15,"ar":"عِدَّةَ","en_gloss":"the number","transliteration":"ʿiddata","verse_key":"9:37"},{"pos":16,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"which","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"9:37"},{"pos":17,"ar":"حَرَّمَ","en_gloss":"Allah has made unlawful","transliteration":"ḥarrama","verse_key":"9:37"},{"pos":18,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah has made unlawful","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"9:37"},{"pos":19,"ar":"فَيُحِلُّوا۟","en_gloss":"and making lawful","transliteration":"fayuḥillū","verse_key":"9:37"},{"pos":20,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"9:37"},{"pos":21,"ar":"حَرَّمَ","en_gloss":"Allah has made unlawful","transliteration":"ḥarrama","verse_key":"9:37"},{"pos":22,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ ۚ","en_gloss":"Allah has made unlawful","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"9:37"},{"pos":23,"ar":"زُيِّنَ","en_gloss":"Is made fair-seeming","transliteration":"zuyyina","verse_key":"9:37"},{"pos":24,"ar":"لَهُمْ","en_gloss":"to them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"9:37"},{"pos":25,"ar":"سُوٓءُ","en_gloss":"(the) evil","transliteration":"sūu","verse_key":"9:37"},{"pos":26,"ar":"أَعْمَـٰلِهِمْ ۗ","en_gloss":"(of) their deeds","transliteration":"aʿmālihim","verse_key":"9:37"},{"pos":27,"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"And Allah","transliteration":"wal-lahu","verse_key":"9:37"},{"pos":28,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(does) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"9:37"},{"pos":29,"ar":"يَهْدِى","en_gloss":"guide","transliteration":"yahdī","verse_key":"9:37"},{"pos":30,"ar":"ٱلْقَوْمَ","en_gloss":"the people ","transliteration":"l-qawma","verse_key":"9:37"},{"pos":31,"ar":"ٱلْكَـٰفِرِينَ","en_gloss":"the disbelievers","transliteration":"l-kāfirīna","verse_key":"9:37"},{"pos":32,"ar":"٣٧","en_gloss":"(37)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"9:37"}]},{"verse_key":"9:38","surah":9,"ayah":38,"ar_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ مَا لَكُمْ إِذَا قِيلَ لَكُمُ ٱنفِرُوا۟ فِى سَبِيلِ ٱللَّهِ ٱثَّاقَلْتُمْ إِلَى ٱلْأَرْضِ ۚ أَرَضِيتُم بِٱلْحَيَوٰةِ ٱلدُّنْيَا مِنَ ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ ۚ فَمَا مَتَـٰعُ ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ ٱلدُّنْيَا فِى ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ إِلَّا قَلِيلٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Believers, why, when it is said to you, ‘Go and fight in God’s way,’ do you feel weighed down to the ground? Do you prefer this world to the life to come? How small the enjoyment of this world is, compared with the life to come!","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","en_gloss":"O you who believe","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","verse_key":"9:38"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"O you who believe","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"9:38"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ءَامَنُوا۟","en_gloss":"O you who believe","transliteration":"āmanū","verse_key":"9:38"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"What","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"9:38"},{"pos":5,"ar":"لَكُمْ","en_gloss":"(is the matter) with you","transliteration":"lakum","verse_key":"9:38"},{"pos":6,"ar":"إِذَا","en_gloss":"when","transliteration":"idhā","verse_key":"9:38"},{"pos":7,"ar":"قِيلَ","en_gloss":"it is said","transliteration":"qīla","verse_key":"9:38"},{"pos":8,"ar":"لَكُمُ","en_gloss":"to you","transliteration":"lakumu","verse_key":"9:38"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱنفِرُوا۟","en_gloss":"go forth","transliteration":"infirū","verse_key":"9:38"},{"pos":10,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"9:38"},{"pos":11,"ar":"سَبِيلِ","en_gloss":"(the) way","transliteration":"sabīli","verse_key":"9:38"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"9:38"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱثَّاقَلْتُمْ","en_gloss":"you cling heavily","transliteration":"ithāqaltum","verse_key":"9:38"},{"pos":14,"ar":"إِلَى","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"ilā","verse_key":"9:38"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضِ ۚ","en_gloss":"the earth","transliteration":"l-arḍi","verse_key":"9:38"},{"pos":16,"