ed him when the disbelievers drove him out: when the two of them were in the cave, he [Muhammad] said to his companion, ‘Do not worry, God is with us,’ and God sent His calm down to him, aided him with forces invisible to you, and brought down the disbelievers’ plan. God’s plan is higher: God is almighty and wise.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"If not","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"9:40"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تَنصُرُوهُ","en_gloss":"you help him","transliteration":"tanṣurūhu","verse_key":"9:40"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فَقَدْ","en_gloss":"certainly","transliteration":"faqad","verse_key":"9:40"},{"pos":4,"ar":"نَصَرَهُ","en_gloss":"Allah helped him","transliteration":"naṣarahu","verse_key":"9:40"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah helped him","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"9:40"},{"pos":6,"ar":"إِذْ","en_gloss":"when","transliteration":"idh","verse_key":"9:40"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أَخْرَجَهُ","en_gloss":"drove him out","transliteration":"akhrajahu","verse_key":"9:40"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"9:40"},{"pos":9,"ar":"كَفَرُوا۟","en_gloss":"disbelieved","transliteration":"kafarū","verse_key":"9:40"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ثَانِىَ","en_gloss":"the second","transliteration":"thāniya","verse_key":"9:40"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱثْنَيْنِ","en_gloss":"(of) the two","transliteration":"ith'nayni","verse_key":"9:40"},{"pos":12,"ar":"إِذْ","en_gloss":"when","transliteration":"idh","verse_key":"9:40"},{"pos":13,"ar":"هُمَا","en_gloss":"they both","transliteration":"humā","verse_key":"9:40"},{"pos":14,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"(were) in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"9:40"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱلْغَارِ","en_gloss":"the cave","transliteration":"l-ghāri","verse_key":"9:40"},{"pos":16,"ar":"إِذْ","en_gloss":"when","transliteration":"idh","verse_key":"9:40"},{"pos":17,"ar":"يَقُولُ","en_gloss":"he said","transliteration":"yaqūlu","verse_key":"9:40"},{"pos":18,"ar":"لِصَـٰحِبِهِۦ","en_gloss":"to his companion","trans